Avon Drama Studio.description:
A heartfelt musical comedy which follows Woody, a cowboy doll who belongs to a young boy named Andy, who sees his position as favourite toy jeopardized when his parents buy him a Buzz Lightyear, a cool, new action figure who thinks he’s a real Space Ranger. With Andy's family moving to a new house any day, Woody and Buzz must put their differences aside to escape the clutches their maladjusted neighbour, Sid Phillips.

Featuring existing musical theatre songs with brand new, original lyrics!

